2. Select the keyframes you want to ease.
3. Go to **Animation > Keyframe Assistant > Easy Ease**, or press **F9**.

Eased keyframes change from diamonds to an hourglass shape. To check the speed, open the **Graph Editor**. A linear move shows a flat speed line, and an eased one rises and falls in a smooth hump.

